From 1667cad4581f3a33139c4cbb495348a7274f18bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 05:03:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] FBar kernels: data stored by element of the material

The data of the tangent operator of the FBar formulation are stored by
element of the material instead of by element of the mesh: the vector
`a` of the rank one matrices is computed by the new function
`addMaterialInnerForces`, the vector `b` and the determinants at the
centers of the elements (`centers`, which no longer store the
derivative of the determinant) are indexed by element of the material.

Tests: the face x = 0 is clamped in the cases of the FBar formulation
(non homogeneous solution), FBar cases with an imposed pressure (stiffness
matrices element by element), with two materials and with quadratic
elements (new option `order`).
